{"id":"dda2a16dfc5a9603","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-fat-stationary-set.md","title":"ZFC Fat Stationary Set","display":"df-zfc-fat-stationary-set — ZFC Fat Stationary Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-fat-stationary-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-fat-stationary-set"],"display":"df-zfc-fat-stationary-set — ZFC Fat Stationary Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-fat-stationary-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-fat-stationary-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-fat-stationary-set — ZFC Fat Stationary Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"955717781e40a938\" href=\"?note=955717781e40a938\" title=\"58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set\">58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\kappa\\in V,\\ S\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(S,\\kappa\\in V,\\ S\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FatStationarySet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcComb9FatStationarySet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FatStationarySet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcComb9FatStationarySet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"955717781e40a938\" href=\"?note=955717781e40a938\" title=\"58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set\">58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fat\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{FatStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb9FatStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fat\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{FatStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb9FatStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This compatibility alias uses the canonical definition: every club intersection contains closed subsets of every order type below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Requiring a club subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> inside every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\cap C\">\\(S\\cap C\\)</span> would instead say that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> contains a club, which is strictly stronger than fat stationarity.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set","status":"resolved","id":"955717781e40a938","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set","status":"resolved","id":"955717781e40a938","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FatStationarySet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcComb9FatStationarySet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,\\kappa\\in V,\\ S\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FatStationarySet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcComb9FatStationarySet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fat\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{FatStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb9FatStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"S\\cap C","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1040,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1872","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-fat-stationary-set.md|58-df-zfc-fat-stationary-set]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","955717781e40a938"]}